                     BEFORE THE NEW MEXICO PUBLIC REGULATION COMMISSION
Order Partially Granting Joint Motion                                  Docket No. 25-00079-UT
to Extend Rate Suspension Period


IT IS THEREFORE ORDERED:

        A.      The Joint Motion IS PARTIALLY GRANTED.

        B.      The rate suspension period for SPS’s Advice Notice No. 341 is extended until

November 30, 2026.

        ISSUED under the Seal of the Commission at Santa Fe, New Mexico, this 12th day of

March, 2026.

                                 NEW MEXICO PUBLIC REGULATION COMMISSION




